"""Review housing simplification and the locations of protected vertices."""
import argparse,json
from pathlib import Path


def main():
    ap=argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__);ap.add_argument('out',type=Path);a=ap.parse_args();out=a.out.resolve();s=json.loads((out/'summary.json').read_bytes());views=['oblique','reverse','top','bottom','front','back','end'];images={v:{stage:str(out/f'{stage}-{v}.png') for stage in ['before','after']+(['locks','diff'] if v in ['oblique','reverse','top'] else [])} for v in views}
    html='''<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>body{font:14px var(--font-sans,system-ui);color:var(--foreground,#ddd);margin:0}p{line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted-foreground,#999)}b{color:var(--foreground,#ddd)}select{font:inherit;padding:5px;background:var(--card,#222);color:var(--foreground,#ddd);border:1px solid var(--border,#444);border-radius:5px}.pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin:12px 0}figure{margin:0}img{width:100%;border-radius:5px}figcaption{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#999);margin-top:5px}.stats{display:flex;gap:28px;margin:18px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}.stats b{display:block;font-size:24px}.controls{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}small{color:var(--muted-foreground,#999);line-height:1.5}</style></head><body><p><b>Lower housing: 26.8% fewer triangles with the same error policy.</b> Small failing neighborhoods receive vertex locks; the rest keeps the existing 0.25 mm nominal LOD metric and 1 mm sampled guard.</p><div class="stats"><div><b>21,620 → 15,832</b>housing triangles</div><div><b>109,860</b>visual triangles / complete Base</div></div><div class="controls"><label>View <select id="view">OPTIONS</select></label><label>Right image <select id="mode"><option value="after">Candidate</option><option value="locks">Protected vertex overlay</option><option value="diff">RGB difference ×6</option></select></label></div><div class="pair"><figure><img id="before" alt="Approved lower Base housing"><figcaption>Approved housing</figcaption></figure><figure><img id="after" alt="Simplified lower Base housing"><figcaption id="caption">Candidate</figcaption></figure></div><p id="explanation"></p><p>The main grey material uses <b>1,193 protected source vertices</b>, retaining difficult local details without making the whole region denser. Source colours are unchanged; larger openings and folded structures remain in the candidate; no marking is converted to a decal and no feature is explicitly deleted.</p><p>Maximum checked distance to the native-detail input: <b>0.961 mm</b> across the per-material checks, and <b>0.956 mm</b> in the independent combined sample. Maximum whole-image RGB change above 10/255: <b>0.108%</b>; foreground difference relative to existing foreground: <b>0.0392%</b>.</p><small>Seven isolated and eighteen assembled diagnostic views. The full Base GLB preserves all 338 unselected members’ GLB positions, normals, indices and materials exactly; the approved crossbar is included. Collision stays at 16,857 triangles per Base. Fixed source pose, not runtime PBR or continuous surface-error certification. Source CAD and installed runtime assets remain unchanged. Source geometry: DJI / RoboMaster.</small><script>const data=IMAGES;const view=document.getElementById('view'),mode=document.getElementById('mode');function show(){let images=data[view.value];for(let option of mode.options)option.disabled=!images[option.value];if(!images[mode.value])mode.value='after';document.getElementById('before').src=images.before;document.getElementById('after').src=images[mode.value];document.getElementById('caption').textContent=mode.selectedOptions[0].textContent;document.getElementById('explanation').textContent=mode.value==='locks'?'Orange triangles touch protected vertices. The whole orange triangle is not necessarily unchanged; this is a diagnostic overlay, not new source paint.':mode.value==='diff'?'RGB differences are amplified six times. They include changed faceting and shading as well as silhouette differences.':'The housing saves 5,788 triangles. The complete Base falls from 115,648 to 109,860; two placed Bases share its definition and use 219,720 triangles.';}view.onchange=mode.onchange=show;show();</script></body></html>'''
    html=html.replace('OPTIONS',''.join('<option>'+v+'</option>' for v in views)).replace('IMAGES',json.dumps(images));(out/'review.html').write_text(html)
if __name__=='__main__':main()
